{"id":"338538aaf52f60c4","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-sequence.md","title":"Natural-Number Pairing and Finite Sequence Codes","display":"df-sequence — Natural-Number Pairing and Finite Sequence Codes","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-sequence","aliases":["67-df-sequence"],"display":"df-sequence — Natural-Number Pairing and Finite Sequence Codes","depends_on":[],"revision_status":"locally-reconstructed","machine_verified":false,"verification_status":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sequence — Natural-Number Pairing and Finite Sequence Codes"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-reconstructed"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>所有变量在元层自然数中取值。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a,b\\rangle_\\#=2^a(2b+1)-1\">\\(\\langle a,b\\rangle_\\#=2^a(2b+1)-1\\)</span> 是自然数配对；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_0,\\pi_1\">\\(\\pi_0,\\pi_1\\)</span> 为其唯一逆分量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(s\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；序列编码采用以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 为终点的配对链。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Len}\">\\(\\operatorname{Len}\\)</span> 的递归每步严格减小正输入，故为全函数；该编码的全部自然数都是合法序列码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(p)_i\">\\((p)_i\\)</span> 超过序列长度时总化为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>；有效下标条件必须另写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(p)\">\\(i&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(p)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\langle a,b\\rangle_\\#&amp;\\coloneqq2^a(2b+1)-1,\\\\\n\\pi_0(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\max\\{a\\le n+1:2^a\\mid n+1\\},&amp;\n\\pi_1(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\frac{(n+1)/2^{\\pi_0(n)}-1}{2},\\\\\n\\operatorname{enc}(\\epsilon)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle a\\rangle{}^\\frown s)&amp;\\coloneqq1+\\langle a,\\operatorname{enc}(s)\\rangle_\\#,\\\\\n\\operatorname{tail}(0)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;\\operatorname{tail}(p+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\\pi_1(p),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Len}(0)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;\\operatorname{Len}(p+1)&amp;\\coloneqq1+\\operatorname{Len}(\\pi_1(p)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{head}(0)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;\\operatorname{head}(p+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\\pi_0(p),\\\\\n\\operatorname{tail}^{0}(p)&amp;\\coloneqq p,&amp;\\operatorname{tail}^{i+1}(p)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{tail}(\\operatorname{tail}^{i}(p)),\\\\\n(p)_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{head}(\\operatorname{tail}^{i}(p)),&amp;\\operatorname{Seq}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow p\\in\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\operatorname{dec}(p)&amp;\\coloneqq((p)_i)_{i&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(p)},&amp;\\mathrm{Seq}&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Seq}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\langle a,b\\rangle_\\#&amp;\\coloneqq2^a(2b+1)-1,\\\\\n\\pi_0(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\max\\{a\\le n+1:2^a\\mid n+1\\},&amp;\n\\pi_1(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\frac{(n+1)/2^{\\pi_0(n)}-1}{2},\\\\\n\\operatorname{enc}(\\epsilon)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle a\\rangle{}^\\frown s)&amp;\\coloneqq1+\\langle a,\\operatorname{enc}(s)\\rangle_\\#,\\\\\n\\operatorname{tail}(0)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;\\operatorname{tail}(p+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\\pi_1(p),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Len}(0)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;\\operatorname{Len}(p+1)&amp;\\coloneqq1+\\operatorname{Len}(\\pi_1(p)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{head}(0)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;\\operatorname{head}(p+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\\pi_0(p),\\\\\n\\operatorname{tail}^{0}(p)&amp;\\coloneqq p,&amp;\\operatorname{tail}^{i+1}(p)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{tail}(\\operatorname{tail}^{i}(p)),\\\\\n(p)_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{head}(\\operatorname{tail}^{i}(p)),&amp;\\operatorname{Seq}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow p\\in\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\operatorname{dec}(p)&amp;\\coloneqq((p)_i)_{i&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(p)},&amp;\\mathrm{Seq}&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Seq}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这给出本册自己的明确编码，不声称与未提供的外册编码或原书具体码值逐字相同。结构递归可按输入码作有界历程递归实现，所列操作均为原始递归。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\langle a,b\\rangle_\\#=2^a(2b+1)-1","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_0,\\pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Len}","display":false},{"tex":"(p)_i","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"i<\\operatorname{Len}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\langle a,b\\rangle_\\#&\\coloneqq2^a(2b+1)-1,\\\\\n\\pi_0(n)&\\coloneqq\\max\\{a\\le n+1:2^a\\mid n+1\\},&\n\\pi_1(n)&\\coloneqq\\frac{(n+1)/2^{\\pi_0(n)}-1}{2},\\\\\n\\operatorname{enc}(\\epsilon)&\\coloneqq0,&\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle a\\rangle{}^\\frown s)&\\coloneqq1+\\langle a,\\operatorname{enc}(s)\\rangle_\\#,\\\\\n\\operatorname{tail}(0)&\\coloneqq0,&\\operatorname{tail}(p+1)&\\coloneqq\\pi_1(p),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Len}(0)&\\coloneqq0,&\\operatorname{Len}(p+1)&\\coloneqq1+\\operatorname{Len}(\\pi_1(p)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{head}(0)&\\coloneqq0,&\\operatorname{head}(p+1)&\\coloneqq\\pi_0(p),\\\\\n\\operatorname{tail}^{0}(p)&\\coloneqq p,&\\operatorname{tail}^{i+1}(p)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{tail}(\\operatorname{tail}^{i}(p)),\\\\\n(p)_i&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{head}(\\operatorname{tail}^{i}(p)),&\\operatorname{Seq}(p)&\\Longleftrightarrow p\\in\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\operatorname{dec}(p)&\\coloneqq((p)_i)_{i<\\operatorname{Len}(p)},&\\mathrm{Seq}&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Seq}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2138,"backlinks":[{"id":"5fa3acf328238c71","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$g=c_{L_A}$；$\\operatorname{enc},\\operatorname{Len},(a)_i$ 取 [[67-df-sequence]]。$\\varphi,\\psi$ 为算术公式，$t,u$ 为算术项；下式 $s_a$ 为标准模型中的变量赋值。"},{"id":"189f5355af0e487c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d3b04e0df1122f31","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{fcode}_\\Lambda(F)$ 是先按 $g_\\Lambda$ 递增排列有限集合 $F$ 再编码所得的数；$\\operatorname{enc}$ 取 [[67-df-sequence]]。$\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}$ 取 [[67-df-predicate-logic]]，$\\bot=\\neg(0=0)$。"},{"id":"1e05755479add015","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Seq},\\operatorname{Len},(p)_i$ 取 [[67-df-sequence]]，$\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{\\varnothing}$ 取 [[67-df-predicate-logic]] 的算术语言实例；这里空公理集的局部规则只有逻辑公理、MP 和全称化。"},{"id":"a4af62d1c1b0b08f","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{enc},\\operatorname{Len},(p)_i$ 取 [[67-df-sequence]]。$\\mathrm{PRProg}_k,\\mathrm{PRPred}_1$ 取 [[67-df-primitive-recursive]]；固定 [[67-df-pr-graph-interface]] 的 $\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)$。"},{"id":"55353aba49d6b3f2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"自然数程序码用 [[67-df-sequence]] 的有限列编码递归编码标签和子树；符号 $e$ 同时指程序及其唯一代码，依上下文类型区分。$\\chi_X$ 使用成立取 $1$ 的约定。"},{"id":"ae771d715f89349c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{enc}$ 取 [[67-df-sequence]]；$\\mathrm{in}_{0,L},\\mathrm{in}_{1,L},\\mathrm{in}_{2,L}$ 是 [[67-df-expression]] 的项、公式、有限公式列标签嵌入。$c_L$ 由下式按树递归给出。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-96","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-sequence]] — Natural-Number Pairing and Finite Sequence Codes。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-sequence]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-100","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-sequence]]"}],"outgoing":[]}